{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation started in worktree tapeworm-impl. Surveyed all in-scope seams: _REGISTRY leaves (comment/tag/untag/archive/set-verify-commands), _ARGV_REGISTRY (create/idea/edit/link/unlink/revert/set-file-impact/attach-commits/session-log), lifecycle (transition/claim/reopen). Notable consumer found: rebar_reconciler/conflict_bug_filing.py parses 'rebar create' stdout via lines[-1] — will switch it to --output json as part of the normalization (invariants.py's regex extractor is already robust). Plan: new _commands/_confirm.py (context + global-flag extraction + emit helpers), router wrapper in _cli/__init__.py before partition dispatch, per-seam outcome returns (None-returning unconsumed seams), add_dependency gains a parallel on_outcome callback (dict|None return untouched)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786774369231458001,"uuid":"37586caf-6048-4fa2-b9e7-d76dba15e346"}